    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/ccd09e9391d088379cd097eeb0ebd41e.avif?t=1752670816\" data-has-big width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea8 <strong>INTERGALACTIC CHAOS, CO-OP STYLE</strong> \ud83d\udea8</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grab your crew and dive into the galaxy\u2019s messiest job.\u00a0</strong><br><strong>Scan, sort, and launch absurd cargo before your station goes BOOM.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/49c568c6144d2fed13f613bc706acd83.poster.avif?t=1752670816\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/49c568c6144d2fed13f613bc706acd83.webm?t=1752670816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/49c568c6144d2fed13f613bc706acd83.mp4?t=1752670816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE MOST DANGEROUS JOB IN THE GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your station receives cargo nonstop: screaming llamas, leaking dark matter, radioactive cubes\u2026 or things that definitely move when you\u2019re not looking.<br><br>Scan them, decontaminate them, reroute them \u2014 or risk turning your entire station into a flying nightmare. One mistake is all it takes for the chaos to spiral. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/0b99c54367959d4ce4ef353a27264a31.poster.avif?t=1752670816\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/0b99c54367959d4ce4ef353a27264a31.webm?t=1752670816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/0b99c54367959d4ce4ef353a27264a31.mp4?t=1752670816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAMWORK OVER IMPLOSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fires. Gravity failures. Vortex malfunctions. You\u2019ll need to work together, shout orders, and maybe even shower mid-run to stay alive.<br><br>No one survives alone in *Space Chaos*.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/6bb9d0f33b29adf6333ffd102d842776.poster.avif?t=1752670816\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/6bb9d0f33b29adf6333ffd102d842776.webm?t=1752670816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/6bb9d0f33b29adf6333ffd102d842776.mp4?t=1752670816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM ZERO TO SPACE LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn galactic reputation, unlock new zones, and customize your station with the dumbest upgrades known to spacekind.<br> <br><strong>Face absurd run modifiers like solar flares or low-gravity madness. No shift is the same.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/ccd09e9391d088379cd097eeb0ebd41e.avif?t=1752670816\" data-has-big width=800 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea8 <strong>INTERGALACTIC CHAOS, CO-OP STYLE</strong> \ud83d\udea8</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grab your crew and dive into the galaxy\u2019s messiest job.\u00a0</strong><br><strong>Scan, sort, and launch absurd cargo before your station goes BOOM.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/49c568c6144d2fed13f613bc706acd83.poster.avif?t=1752670816\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/49c568c6144d2fed13f613bc706acd83.webm?t=1752670816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/49c568c6144d2fed13f613bc706acd83.mp4?t=1752670816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE MOST DANGEROUS JOB IN THE GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your station receives cargo nonstop: screaming llamas, leaking dark matter, radioactive cubes\u2026 or things that definitely move when you\u2019re not looking.<br><br>Scan them, decontaminate them, reroute them \u2014 or risk turning your entire station into a flying nightmare. One mistake is all it takes for the chaos to spiral. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/0b99c54367959d4ce4ef353a27264a31.poster.avif?t=1752670816\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/0b99c54367959d4ce4ef353a27264a31.webm?t=1752670816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/0b99c54367959d4ce4ef353a27264a31.mp4?t=1752670816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAMWORK OVER IMPLOSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fires. Gravity failures. Vortex malfunctions. You\u2019ll need to work together, shout orders, and maybe even shower mid-run to stay alive.<br><br>No one survives alone in *Space Chaos*.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/6bb9d0f33b29adf6333ffd102d842776.poster.avif?t=1752670816\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/6bb9d0f33b29adf6333ffd102d842776.webm?t=1752670816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819410/extras/6bb9d0f33b29adf6333ffd102d842776.mp4?t=1752670816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FROM ZERO TO SPACE LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn galactic reputation, unlock new zones, and customize your station with the dumbest upgrades known to spacekind.<br> <br><strong>Face absurd run modifiers like solar flares or low-gravity madness. No shift is the same.</strong></p>",
